---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption={"Components and the paths between them. The gateway is the only door to the data; the admin console is just another client of its API."}>
<svg viewBox="0 0 960 580" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-t arch-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<title id="arch-t">crowpond architecture</title>
<desc id="arch-d">Producers send records and file descriptions to the gateway. The gateway stores recent records in PostgreSQL and archives whole past days to Parquet in an S3-compatible bucket. Files are uploaded straight to the bucket with presigned URLs. Consumers read through the gateway, which reads across hot and archived data. The admin console talks only to the gateway API and has its own database.</desc>
<defs>
<marker id="arch-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-fill"/></marker>
<marker id="arch-ac" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-accent"/></marker>
</defs>
<text x="20" y="120" class="t-h" text-anchor="start">PRODUCERS</text><text x="770" y="120" class="t-h" text-anchor="start">CONSUMERS</text><rect x="20" y="135" width="170" height="90" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="105" y="167" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Streams and apps</text><text x="105" y="185" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">JSON records,</text><text x="105" y="203" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">bulk batches</text><rect x="20" y="255" width="170" height="90" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="105" y="287" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">File uploaders</text><text x="105" y="305" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">images, video,</text><text x="105" y="323" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">Parquet, any bytes</text><rect x="770" y="135" width="170" height="90" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="855" y="176" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Apps and dashboards</text><text x="855" y="194" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">list, read, filter</text><rect x="770" y="255" width="170" height="90" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="855" y="287" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Notebooks, batch jobs</text><text x="855" y="305" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">read tables, build</text><text x="855" y="323" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">derived data</text><rect x="330" y="12" width="220" height="66" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="440" y="41" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Admin console</text><text x="440" y="59" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">Laravel, uses the API only</text><rect x="650" y="12" width="200" height="66" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="750" y="41" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Console database</text><text x="750" y="59" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">accounts, console audit</text><polyline points="550,45 650,45" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arch-a)"/><text x="600" y="38" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">own</text><polyline points="440,78 440,130" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arch-a)" marker-start="url(#arch-a)"/><text x="450" y="108" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">HTTP API, admin token</text><rect x="250" y="130" width="460" height="160" rx="10" class="box-accent"/><text x="480" y="156" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Gateway</text><text x="480" y="182" class="t" text-anchor="middle">REST API with bearer tokens, request log and audit log</text><text x="480" y="204" class="t" text-anchor="middle">validates payloads, routes records to tables, labels objects</text><text x="480" y="226" class="t" text-anchor="middle">reads across hot and archived data as one table</text><text x="480" y="262" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">archive job and cleanup job (you schedule them)</text><polyline points="190,180 250,180" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#arch-ac)"/><text x="220" y="170" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">POST</text><polyline points="190,270 250,270" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#arch-ac)"/><text x="220" y="260" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">POST</text><polyline points="710,180 770,180" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#arch-ac)"/><text x="740" y="170" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">GET</text><polyline points="710,270 770,270" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#arch-ac)"/><rect x="110" y="380" width="290" height="110" rx="8" class="box-hot"/><text x="255" y="422" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">PostgreSQL: hot tier</text><text x="255" y="440" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">catalog, typed and bulk tables,</text><text x="255" y="458" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">recent days, audit log</text><rect x="500" y="370" width="440" height="160" rx="10" class="box-cold"/><text x="720" y="396" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">S3-compatible bucket</text><rect x="520" y="412" width="190" height="50" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="615" y="433" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">archive/</text><text x="615" y="451" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">Parquet + .bdo.xml</text><rect x="730" y="412" width="190" height="50" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="825" y="433" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">files</text><text x="825" y="451" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">as uploaded</text><polyline points="330,290 330,380" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arch-a)" marker-start="url(#arch-a)"/><text x="340" y="340" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">live rows</text><polyline points="400,435 520,437" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#arch-ac)"/><text x="460" y="412" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">archive job</text><text x="460" y="428" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">whole days</text><polyline points="620,290 620,412" class="edge" marker-end="url(#arch-a)" marker-start="url(#arch-a)"/><text x="610" y="322" class="t-muted" text-anchor="end">Parquet reads (digest checked),</text><text x="610" y="338" class="t-muted" text-anchor="end">presigned URLs</text><polyline points="60,345 60,560 830,560 830,462" class="edge-dash" marker-end="url(#arch-a)"/><text x="445" y="552" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">file bytes go straight to the bucket (PUT to a presigned URL), never through the gateway</text><line x1="20" y1="24" x2="60" y2="24" class="edge-accent"/><text x="66" y="28" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">record traffic</text><line x1="20" y1="48" x2="60" y2="48" class="edge-dash"/><text x="66" y="52" class="t-muted" text-anchor="start">file traffic, goes around the gateway</text>
</svg>
</Diagram>
